{"version":1,"content":"<p>OpenAI近日宣佈對ChatGPT語音功能進行重大調整，計劃逐步淘汰現有的「標準語音模式（Standard Voice Mode）」和「高級語音模式（Advanced Voice Mode）」品牌區分，轉而整合為統一的新語音體驗。不過，這一決定在用户社區引發了廣泛爭議，不少長期用户認為新方案削弱了原有功能特色和使用體驗。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585932.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:35:00.118139+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:28:22.999226+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:28:22.999226+00:00","content_hash":"ce5e1b6cbd7157ad5b81b06bc9a5beeeeeb2298cbb9eff66308a7110ed1654e9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}